{"3050950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wilderness and Evolution", "steam_appid": 3050950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Wilderness &amp; Evolution</strong>, you will lead a primitive tribe from the dawn of humanity, guiding your people through a dangerous and unpredictable wilderness on a journey across generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through gathering, crafting, hunting, migration, prayer, and other tribal activities, you must help your clan survive harsh environments, withstand wild beasts, natural disasters, and deadly plagues. Accumulate inspiration and evolution points, unlock new inventions, and guide your tribe from the age of ancient ancestors toward the rise of Homo sapiens — and beyond, into mysterious civilizations waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/359e500c6eedd3a3b5a7ac4e42ff1180.poster.avif?t=1786181845\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/359e500c6eedd3a3b5a7ac4e42ff1180.webm?t=1786181845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/359e500c6eedd3a3b5a7ac4e42ff1180.mp4?t=1786181845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the complete life cycle of primitive humans, from birth to old age and death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunting features turn-based combat, injury systems, and random loot drops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living ecosystem of NPC tribes and creatures: they will develop, migrate, expand, and compete alongside you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover diverse tribal traditions, quirks, and achievement systems that make every adventure different.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tribesman has unique trait cards. Through reproduction, their personalities and abilities can be passed down to future generations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/8415842ba900e12da04a1369a2ec5312.poster.avif?t=1786181845\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/8415842ba900e12da04a1369a2ec5312.webm?t=1786181845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/8415842ba900e12da04a1369a2ec5312.mp4?t=1786181845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gathering System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During gathering activities, all assigned tribesmen roll their dice together.<br>The total dice value determines the amount of resources collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain dice faces, traits, and inventions can provide additional bonuses, allowing your tribe to gather more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/5bc5464b8eb891b13aa8a3ad315bcd15.poster.avif?t=1786181845\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/5bc5464b8eb891b13aa8a3ad315bcd15.webm?t=1786181845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/5bc5464b8eb891b13aa8a3ad315bcd15.mp4?t=1786181845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During crafting, matching the required dice values and colors can greatly improve the quality of crafted weapons and tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your craftsmen wisely and create powerful equipment to help your tribe survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/05cbff670cd78e8e261dea403a60015c.poster.avif?t=1786181845\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/05cbff670cd78e8e261dea403a60015c.webm?t=1786181845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/05cbff670cd78e8e261dea403a60015c.mp4?t=1786181845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunting System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During hunting:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red dice</strong> determine attack power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Green dice</strong> improve accuracy and evasion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blue dice</strong> increase critical chance and armor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat dangerous creatures to obtain valuable materials and food for your tribe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/3d55556640c50dd04280f58f544bc8f8.poster.avif?t=1786181845\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/3d55556640c50dd04280f58f544bc8f8.webm?t=1786181845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/3d55556640c50dd04280f58f544bc8f8.mp4?t=1786181845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Growth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When tribesmen successfully complete activities, they gain experience and upgrade their ability dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They may also discover unique trait cards that shape their strengths, personalities, and future generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/534e0545cedf387cfa8c9bcba5074299.poster.avif?t=1786181845\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/534e0545cedf387cfa8c9bcba5074299.webm?t=1786181845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/534e0545cedf387cfa8c9bcba5074299.mp4?t=1786181845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Migration &amp; Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your tribe across vast unknown lands, discover new environments, search for food and rare resources, survive natural disasters, and overcome increasingly powerful creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/9835cd4701828725e097fd5ce82ced8e.poster.avif?t=1786181845\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/9835cd4701828725e097fd5ce82ced8e.webm?t=1786181845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/9835cd4701828725e097fd5ce82ced8e.mp4?t=1786181845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recommended Tagline</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead your tribe through the brutal wilderness, survive across generations, evolve, and witness the birth of human civilization.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Wilderness &amp; Evolution</strong>, you will lead a primitive tribe from the dawn of humanity, guiding your people through a dangerous and unpredictable wilderness on a journey across generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through gathering, crafting, hunting, migration, prayer, and other tribal activities, you must help your clan survive harsh environments, withstand wild beasts, natural disasters, and deadly plagues. Accumulate inspiration and evolution points, unlock new inventions, and guide your tribe from the age of ancient ancestors toward the rise of Homo sapiens — and beyond, into mysterious civilizations waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/359e500c6eedd3a3b5a7ac4e42ff1180.poster.avif?t=1786181845\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/359e500c6eedd3a3b5a7ac4e42ff1180.webm?t=1786181845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3050950/extras/359e500c6eedd3a3b5a7ac4e42ff1180.mp4?t=1786181845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragrap